        WORK
      </button>

      <button
        class="about-tab"
        type="button"
        data-about-tab="interests"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        INTERESTS
      </button>

      <button
        class="about-tab"
        type="button"
        data-about-tab="vault"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        VAULT
      </button>
    </nav>

    <div class="about-content-stage">
      <div
        class="about-content-window"
        id="about-content-window"
      >
        <!-- About -->

        <section
          class="about-content-panel about-content-panel--biography"
          data-about-panel="about"
        >
          <div class="about-biography">
            <p>
              Hi, I’m Prakhar. I’m a multimedia design student,
              filmmaker, photographer and occasional victim of CSS.
            </p>

            <p>
              Most of my time goes into making films, taking
              photographs, designing strange little websites and
              convincing myself that every new project is not
              another side quest. I like stories that feel slightly
              unsettling, visually interesting and human enough to
              stay with you after the screen goes dark.
            </p>

            <p>
              I have written and directed short films, worked behind
              the camera, explored streets with a camera in hand and
              spent an unreasonable amount of time moving elements
              two pixels to the left.
            </p>

            <p>
              This website is my inventory. It contains films,
              photographs, experiments, unfinished thoughts and a
              few projects that survived the final boss known as the
